# Tenant workspaces — real configs, credentials, data files, and run output.
# A tenant is a folder here (see docs/cli.md); none of it belongs in the repo.
# The runnable examples/ folder is the committed counterpart.
userdata/

# Editor and OS junk files
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Credentials, wherever they land. Your real ones live under userdata/ (already
# ignored above); this is the backstop for a key file dropped somewhere else.
**/service_account.json